<p><span style="font-size:12px;"><span style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;">Good Afternoon,<br />
<br />
Thank you for reaching out to Qantas Freight.<br />
<br />
While we are unable to give specific dangerous goods advice, dangerous goods are accepted in accordance to the IATA Dangerous Goods Regulations. Please refer to the IATA Dangerous Goods Manual for further details. Qantas specific regulations can be found under the carrier variations section of the manual. All dangerous goods are subject to a dangerous goods check and no confirmation of acceptance can be given before this time.<br />
<br />
<br />
Kind regards,<br />
<br />
<b>Customer Service</b><br />
Qantas Freight</span></span><br clear="none" />
<br clear="none" />
